@startuml
actor Client
participant "Mobile App" as App
participant "Brokerage API" as API
database DB
participant "Check Service" as Check
participant "Brokerage Core" as Core

Client -> App: Открыть брокерский счёт
App -> API: POST /applications
API -> DB: create DRAFT
DB --> API: applicationId
API --> App: 201 Created

Client -> App: Подтвердить условия и согласия
App -> API: POST /applications/{id}/consents
API -> DB: save consents
API --> App: 204 No Content

Client -> App: Отправить заявку
App -> API: POST /applications/{id}/submit
API -> DB: status=SUBMITTED
API -> Check: run checks
Check --> API: APPROVED
API -> Core: create brokerage account
Core --> API: accountId
API -> DB: status=ACCOUNT_OPENED
API --> App: success
App --> Client: Счёт открыт
@enduml
